{"architecture_findings":["[事實] OrderStore 是單一 Dictionary<string, Order> 加上一個鎖物件 _g。Put、TryGet、TryCancel 都用同一把全域鎖。Cancellation.Cancel(before) 在鎖內執行，before 與 result 在同一個臨界區內取得並寫回。","[事實] Transitioned(before, result) 雖然在鎖外計算，用的是鎖內取得的 before 快照。因此依程式閱讀，同一訂單的並發重複取消只會有一次 transitioned=true，也只會入列一則通知。這是程式推論，尚未由本輪壓測驗證。","[事實] 圖與程式的差異：cancel 請求路徑上除了 OrderStore 鎖，還有兩個圖上沒畫的全域序列化點。(1) Metrics 用單一鎖 _g，Inc、ObserveLatency、Render 都會取；/metrics 的 Render 會在鎖內組字串並呼叫 GC.GetTotalMemory。(2) JsonlLog.Write 在鎖內做 File.AppendAllText，每筆 cancel 都是同步開檔、寫檔、關檔。","[事實] POST /orders 與 GET /orders/{id} 不寫 logs.jsonl，只有 cancel 寫。GET 與 Put 取的是同一把 OrderStore 全域鎖。","[事實] 通知在回應之前入列：await channel.Writer.WriteAsync(n) 完成後才回傳 HTTP 結果。Channel 是 CreateUnbounded，沒有背壓，入列幾乎不會阻塞，佇列長度也沒有上限。深度只能從 oc_notify_queue_depth 及 cancel log 的 queue_depth 觀察。","[事實] NotificationWorker 是單一 BackgroundService，逐筆循序處理。送 sink 失敗時依 200/400/800ms 退避重試，全部失敗進 dead_letter。重試期間後面的通知全部等待（head-of-line）。HttpClient 沒設 Timeout，採預設 100 秒。","[事實] 送達順序：預設模式下單一消費者大致 FIFO。notify_drop_over_queue 故障會把通知重排到隊尾，最多 5 次；sync_notify 故障則在各請求中並行送出。兩者都會打亂先後，所以對帳必須用 notification_id / run_id，不能靠順序。","[事實] 故障注入入口有兩個：OC_FAULTS JSON（notify_drop_over_queue、notify_delay_ms、retain_payloads、sync_notify）與 OC_TEST_DELAY_MS。後者在鎖外、latency 量測區間內最多加 100ms。本輪必須確認 startup log 為 faults_loaded=false 且 OC_TEST_DELAY_MS 未設，否則結果不代表候選版預設行為。","[事實] sync_notify 路徑會在請求路徑上同步等待 sink，含重試，最壞約 1.4 秒加上 HTTP 時間。圖中「回應前入列、非同步送達」只描述非故障路徑。","[事實] 記憶體：OrderStore 沒有任何刪除或淘汰，訂單數隨迭代線性增加。每程序預估建單數：smoke 約 20、spike 約 40+600+40=680、sustain 約 1200。這是預期成長，不能直接當成 leak 證據。Retained 只在 retain_payloads 故障下使用，上限 256 筆、每筆 256 字元。無界 Channel 積壓時也會佔用記憶體。logs.jsonl 在磁碟上持續成長。","[事實] /metrics 提供 oc_gc_heap_bytes（GC.GetTotalMemory(false)，不強制 GC）、oc_working_set_bytes、oc_gc_collections_gen2、oc_notify_queue_depth、cancel latency histogram 與各計數器。沒有 CPU 指標，若外部未另行收集，CPU 不可填寫或推測。","[事實] 伺服器端 latency histogram 只涵蓋進到 TryCancel 並回 200/409 的 cancel，401 與 404 不呼叫 ObserveLatency。t0 在 handler 內開始，不含 Kestrel 排隊與連線時間。bucket 有 250 邊界但粒度粗。k6 的 cancel_ms 是 client 端含 loopback 的時間，兩者不可混用。","[事實] notify_sent_total 只在 sink 回 2xx 後才加（v1.1.0 註解與程式一致）。notify_enqueued_total 在入列時加。排空判定可比對 enqueued、sent + dead_letter、queue_depth=0，再用原始收據逐一對 notification_id。","[事實] 授權只檢查 X-Actor 是否非空；POST /orders 與 GET 完全沒有授權。POST /orders 的 body 格式錯誤會拋例外，由中介層回 500。Put 會覆寫同 id 訂單，所以跨 scenario 的唯一 ID 是必要條件，不是美化。","[事實] /ready 永遠回 ready=true，不反映 worker 或 sink 狀態。","[事實] Domain 行為：已取消再取消時 RefundRequested=order.Paid && !order.Cancelled=false，Transitioned=false，回 200 idempotent 且 notification_id=null。已出貨回 409、不通知。本負載只走已付款未出貨路徑，已出貨與未付款路徑不在本輪覆蓋範圍。","[假設] 回應 JSON 欄位名：ASP.NET Core minimal API 預設 camelCase 命名策略，Order record 應序列化為 shipped/paid/cancelled，匿名物件的 snake_case 欄位（refund_requested、notification_id）維持原樣，null 欄位預設會輸出。須以 smoke 實跑確認，腳本 check 依此撰寫。","[假設] spike 峰值 20 it/s（約 80 req/s）時，OrderStore、Metrics、JsonlLog 三把全域鎖加上同步檔案 I/O 可能拉高 cancel 尾端延遲。需對照 k6 cancel_ms、伺服器 histogram 與 log latency_ms 才能判斷，不能只憑架構圖下根因。","[假設] 假 sink 固定回 200 且在本機時，單一 worker 應能跟上 10–20 則通知/秒。若 queue_depth 在峰值後持續單調上升，或 20 秒內無法排空，較可能是 worker 循序 HTTP 吞吐的瓶頸，須以 queue_depth 時序與 sent 速率佐證。","[假設] working set 或 heap 上升主要來自訂單字典與佇列積壓。只有在以訂單數正規化後、跨 gen2 GC 仍持續成長，才值得懷疑 leak。","[事實] 迭代率不等於 RPS：每迭代 4 次 HTTP，smoke 約 4 req/s、spike 約 8→80→8 req/s、sustain 約 40 req/s。maxVUs=50 是每個 scenario 各自的上限；spike 三段在 gracefulStop 期間可能短暫重疊，VU 總數可能超過 50。","[事實] 以下停止條件與前置工作不在 k6 腳本內，需由啟動程序另行執行：整輪 180 秒 timeout、服務退出偵測、20 秒通知排空對帳、十檔 SHA-256 前後核對。","[邊界] 本分析只基於提供的原始碼與計畫，沒有任何執行結果，不構成效能結論、SLA、容量保證或上線許可。auth、durability（記憶體儲存重啟即失）、backup、環境差異都未驗證。"],"scenarios":[{"profile":"smoke","scenario_name":"smoke","executor":"constant-arrival-rate","rate_per_s":1,"duration":"20s","start_time":"0s","approx_http_req_per_s":4,"approx_orders_created":20,"preAllocatedVUs":10,"maxVUs":50},{"profile":"spike","scenario_name":"spike_warmup","executor":"constant-arrival-rate","rate_per_s":2,"duration":"20s","start_time":"0s","approx_http_req_per_s":8,"approx_orders_created":40,"preAllocatedVUs":10,"maxVUs":50},{"profile":"spike","scenario_name":"spike_peak","executor":"constant-arrival-rate","rate_per_s":20,"duration":"30s","start_time":"20s","approx_http_req_per_s":80,"approx_orders_created":600,"preAllocatedVUs":10,"maxVUs":50},{"profile":"spike","scenario_name":"spike_recovery","executor":"constant-arrival-rate","rate_per_s":2,"duration":"20s","start_time":"50s","approx_http_req_per_s":8,"approx_orders_created":40,"preAllocatedVUs":10,"maxVUs":50},{"profile":"sustain","scenario_name":"sustain","executor":"constant-arrival-rate","rate_per_s":10,"duration":"120s","start_time":"0s","approx_http_req_per_s":40,"approx_orders_created":1200,"preAllocatedVUs":10,"maxVUs":50,"note":"短時持續負載，不是 soak"}],"k6_script":"import http from 'k6/http';
import { check } from 'k6';
import { Trend } from 'k6/metrics';
import exec from 'k6/execution';

const PROFILE = __ENV.PROFILE;
const BASE_URL = (__ENV.BASE_URL || '').replace(/\/+$/, '');
const RUN_ID = __ENV.RUN_ID;

if (!BASE_URL) {
  throw new Error('BASE_URL is required');
}
if (!RUN_ID) {
  throw new Error('RUN_ID is required (used for unique order ids and notification reconciliation)');
}

// First cancellation only; the repeat cancel is not part of this trend.
const cancelMs = new Trend('cancel_ms', true);

function arrival(rate, duration, startTime) {
  return {
    executor: 'constant-arrival-rate',
    rate: rate,
    timeUnit: '1s',
    duration: duration,
    startTime: startTime,
    preAllocatedVUs: 10,
    maxVUs: 50,
    tags: { profile: PROFILE },
  };
}

const PROFILES = {
  smoke: {
    smoke: arrival(1, '20s', '0s'),
  },
  spike: {
    spike_warmup: arrival(2, '20s', '0s'),
    spike_peak: arrival(20, '30s', '20s'),
    spike_recovery: arrival(2, '20s', '50s'),
  },
  sustain: {
    sustain: arrival(10, '120s', '0s'),
  },
};

if (!PROFILE || !Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(PROFILES, PROFILE)) {
  throw new Error('Unknown PROFILE: ' + PROFILE + ' (expected one of: ' + Object.keys(PROFILES).join(', ') + ')');
}

export const options = {
  scenarios: PROFILES[PROFILE],
  tags: { run_id: RUN_ID },
  summaryTrendStats: ['avg', 'min', 'med', 'max', 'p(90)', 'p(95)', 'p(99)'],
  thresholds: {
    checks: ['rate==1'],
    http_req_failed: [
      'rate==0',
      { threshold: 'rate<0.05', abortOnFail: true, delayAbortEval: '10s' },
    ],
    cancel_ms: ['p(95)<250'],
    dropped_iterations: ['count==0'],
  },
};

function headers(requestId) {
  return {
    'Content-Type': 'application/json',
    'X-Actor': 'teaching-test',
    'X-Run-Id': RUN_ID,
    'X-Request-Id': requestId,
  };
}

// Invalid or empty JSON yields null so the related checks fail and are counted.
function parseJson(res) {
  try {
    const body = res.json();
    return body !== null && typeof body === 'object' ? body : null;
  } catch (e) {
    return null;
  }
}

export default function () {
  const id = `${RUN_ID}-${exec.scenario.name}-${__VU}-${__ITER}`;
  const orderUrl = `${BASE_URL}/orders/${encodeURIComponent(id)}`;

  const createRes = http.post(`${BASE_URL}/orders`, JSON.stringify({ id: id, paid: true, shipped: false }), {
    headers: headers(id + '-create'),
    tags: { name: 'POST /orders', op: 'create' },
  });
  const created = parseJson(createRes);
  const createOk = check(createRes, {
    'create: status 200': (r) => r.status === 200,
    'create: valid JSON body': () => created !== null,
    'create: id echoed': () => created !== null && created.id === id,
  });
  if (!createOk) {
    return;
  }

  const first = http.post(`${orderUrl}/cancel`, null, {
    headers: headers(id + '-cancel1'),
    tags: { name: 'POST /orders/{id}/cancel', op: 'cancel_first' },
  });
  cancelMs.add(first.timings.duration);
  const firstBody = parseJson(first);
  check(first, {
    'cancel#1: status 200': (r) => r.status === 200,
    'cancel#1: valid JSON body': () => firstBody !== null,
    'cancel#1: transitioned true': () => firstBody !== null && firstBody.transitioned === true,
    'cancel#1: refund_requested true': () => firstBody !== null && firstBody.refund_requested === true,
    'cancel#1: notification_id present': () => firstBody !== null && typeof firstBody.notification_id === 'string' && firstBody.notification_id.length > 0,
  });

  const second = http.post(`${orderUrl}/cancel`, null, {
    headers: headers(id + '-cancel2'),
    tags: { name: 'POST /orders/{id}/cancel', op: 'cancel_repeat' },
  });
  const secondBody = parseJson(second);
  check(second, {
    'cancel#2: status 200': (r) => r.status === 200,
    'cancel#2: valid JSON body': () => secondBody !== null,
    'cancel#2: transitioned false': () => secondBody !== null && secondBody.transitioned === false,
    'cancel#2: refund_requested false': () => secondBody !== null && secondBody.refund_requested === false,
    'cancel#2: notification_id null': () => secondBody !== null && secondBody.notification_id === null,
  });

  const getRes = http.get(orderUrl, {
    headers: headers(id + '-get'),
    tags: { name: 'GET /orders/{id}', op: 'get' },
  });
  const state = parseJson(getRes);
  check(getRes, {
    'get: status 200': (r) => r.status === 200,
    'get: valid JSON body': () => state !== null,
    'get: order.cancelled true': () => state !== null && state.order !== null && typeof state.order === 'object' && state.order.cancelled === true,
  });
}
"}
